The files in patches/, patches_on_minimal/ and patches_ctd/ modify source code of the
Community Earth System Model version 2 (CESM2) and its atmosphere component CAM6,
copyright University Corporation for Atmospheric Research (UCAR). Among them,
src/physics/rrtmg/radiation.F90 is the CAM interface to the RRTMG radiation code, which
is part of the CAM distribution. The unmodified CESM2 code is distributed under the
CESM2 copyright notice and terms of use:
https://www.cesm.ucar.edu/models/cesm2/copyright

